Package: bedrocktrader
Title: Retrieve Minecraft Bedrock Villager Trade Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person('Rento', 'Saijo', email = 'rentosaijo0527@gmail.com', role = c('aut', 'cre', 'cph'), comment = c(ORCID = '0009-0008-4919-7349'))
Description: Retrieves official vanilla Minecraft Bedrock 1.26.30.5 villager
    trade tables and represents their progression, selection, item choices,
    generated outcomes, contextual restrictions, and offer probabilities in
    flat base R data frames.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    digest,
    jsonlite
URL: https://rentosaijo.github.io/bedrocktrader/, https://github.com/RentoSaijo/bedrocktrader
BugReports: https://github.com/RentoSaijo/bedrocktrader/issues
